 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "Every night, a girl",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 1.46,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "climbed a lighthouse to",
   "start": 1.46,
   "end": 2.865,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "wait for a boat",
   "start": 2.865,
   "end": 3.781,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "that never came.",
   "start": 3.781,
   "end": 4.759,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Nora's father was a",
   "start": 5.559,
   "end": 6.775,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "fisherman. The best in",
   "start": 6.775,
   "end": 8.183,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "the village.",
   "start": 8.183,
   "end": 8.951,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "One more catch, and",
   "start": 9.351,
   "end": 10.674,
   "spk": "D"
  },
  {
   "text": "I'll be back before",
   "start": 10.674,
   "end": 11.998,
   "spk": "D"
  },
  {
   "text": "dark, Nora.",
   "start": 11.998,
   "end": 12.764,
   "spk": "D"
  },
  {
   "text": "But that night, the",
   "start": 13.764,
   "end": 15.115,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "sky turned black.",
   "start": 15.115,
   "end": 16.324,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And his boat never",
   "start": 16.724,
   "end": 18.095,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "came back.",
   "start": 18.095,
   "end": 18.857,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "So every night since,",
   "start": 20.264,
   "end": 21.584,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Nora climbed the lighthouse",
   "start": 21.584,
   "end": 23.28,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "stairs.",
   "start": 23.28,
   "end": 23.72,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And lit the lamp",
   "start": 24.12,
   "end": 25.414,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "herself.",
   "start": 25.414,
   "end": 26.061,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "It's been three years,",
   "start": 27.364,
   "end": 28.542,
   "spk": "M"
  },
  {
   "text": "Nora. You have to",
   "start": 28.542,
   "end": 29.452,
   "spk": "M"
  },
  {
   "text": "let it rest.",
   "start": 29.452,
   "end": 30.095,
   "spk": "M"
  },
  {
   "text": "But Nora shook her",
   "start": 30.495,
   "end": 31.875,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "head. Not yet.",
   "start": 31.875,
   "end": 32.948,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Because every beam of",
   "start": 34.248,
   "end": 35.644,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "light swept the water.",
   "start": 35.644,
   "end": 37.107,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Still searching. Still hoping.",
   "start": 37.507,
   "end": 39.747,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then, one stormy night,",
   "start": 41.748,
   "end": 43.351,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "exactly like that one\u2026",
   "start": 43.351,
   "end": 44.884,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "she saw it. A",
   "start": 45.284,
   "end": 46.194,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "small light, far out",
   "start": 46.194,
   "end": 47.595,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "on the water.",
   "start": 47.595,
   "end": 48.505,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Nora ran down every",
   "start": 49.705,
   "end": 51.405,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "single step.",
   "start": 51.405,
   "end": 52.479,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Out into the storm,",
   "start": 52.879,
   "end": 54.328,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "onto the pier.",
   "start": 54.328,
   "end": 55.396,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "A tiny boat, battered",
   "start": 56.496,
   "end": 58.006,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "by the waves, drifting",
   "start": 58.006,
   "end": 59.587,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "in.",
   "start": 59.587,
   "end": 59.803,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And inside it\u2026 an",
   "start": 60.303,
   "end": 61.539,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "old fisherman, half frozen.",
   "start": 61.539,
   "end": 63.503,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "\u2026Nora? Is that really",
   "start": 65.003,
   "end": 66.741,
   "spk": "D"
  },
  {
   "text": "you?",
   "start": 66.741,
   "end": 67.072,
   "spk": "D"
  },
  {
   "text": "It wasn't her father.",
   "start": 70.803,
   "end": 72.488,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "A stranger. Lost at",
   "start": 72.888,
   "end": 74.111,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "sea for weeks, following",
   "start": 74.111,
   "end": 75.656,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "her light home.",
   "start": 75.656,
   "end": 76.621,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "She hugged him anyway.",
   "start": 77.921,
   "end": 79.202,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Because that's what the",
   "start": 79.202,
   "end": 80.541,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "light was for.",
   "start": 80.541,
   "end": 81.356,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Bringing somebody's father home.",
   "start": 81.756,
   "end": 84.273,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "The next night, Nora",
   "start": 85.773,
   "end": 87.063,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "climbed the stairs again.",
   "start": 87.063,
   "end": 88.675,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Still lighting the lamp.",
   "start": 89.175,
   "end": 90.723,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Still searching.",
   "start": 90.723,
   "end": 91.756,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Because somewhere out there,",
   "start": 93.056,
   "end": 94.665,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "someone's family was still",
   "start": 94.665,
   "end": 96.159,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "waiting.",
   "start": 96.159,
   "end": 96.619,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And that light would",
   "start": 97.119,
   "end": 98.455,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "always be burning.",
   "start": 98.455,
   "end": 99.657,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Would you keep the",
   "start": 102.357,
   "end": 103.551,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "light burning for a",
   "start": 103.551,
   "end": 104.811,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "stranger?",
   "start": 104.811,
   "end": 105.408,
   "spk": "N"
  }
 ],
